### HyperGrid API Test Pipeline
### Base URL: http://localhost:4000/api

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api
@deviceId = dev-pixel-7-driver-1

### ==========================================================================
### STEP 1: Kirim Satu Data Deteksi Mentah (Single Ingestion)
### ==========================================================================
# @name createSingleDetection
POST {{baseUrl}}/detections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceId": "{{deviceId}}",
  "latitude": -6.208800,
  "longitude": 106.845600,
  "confidence": 0.94,
  "speedKmh": 42.5,
  "zAccelPeak": 3.85,
  "modelVersion": "v1.0",
  "detectedAt": "2026-09-01T12:00:00.000Z"
}

### ==========================================================================
### STEP 2: Kirim Batch Data Deteksi Mentah (Bulk Ingestion dari Mobile)
### ==========================================================================
# @name createBatchDetection
POST {{baseUrl}}/detections/batch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "detections": [
    {
      "deviceId": "{{deviceId}}",
      "latitude": -6.208850,
      "longitude": 106.845650,
      "confidence": 0.91,
      "speedKmh": 41.0,
      "zAccelPeak": 4.10,
      "modelVersion": "v1.0",
      "detectedAt": "2026-09-01T12:00:05.000Z"
    },
    {
      "deviceId": "{{deviceId}}",
      "latitude": -6.208920,
      "longitude": 106.845710,
      "confidence": 0.88,
      "speedKmh": 39.5,
      "zAccelPeak": 3.65,
      "modelVersion": "v1.0",
      "detectedAt": "2026-09-01T12:00:10.000Z"
    },
    {
      "deviceId": "dev-dashboard-cam-99",
      "latitude": -6.205200,
      "longitude": 106.849000,
      "confidence": 0.96,
      "speedKmh": 25.0,
      "zAccelPeak": 5.20,
      "modelVersion": "v1.0",
      "detectedAt": "2026-09-01T12:00:15.000Z"
    }
  ]
}

### ==========================================================================
### STEP 3: Cek Riwayat Deteksi Berdasarkan Device ID
### ==========================================================================
# @name getHistoryByDevice
GET {{baseUrl}}/detections/device/{{deviceId}}
Accept: application/json

### ==========================================================================
### STEP 4: Query Titik Pothole Cluster di Viewport Peta (Bounding Box)
### ==========================================================================
# @name getPotholesInBoundingBox
GET {{baseUrl}}/pothole-clusters?minLat=-6.2200&minLon=106.8300&maxLat=-6.2000&maxLon=106.8600&status=active
Accept: application/json

### ==========================================================================
### STEP 5: Driver Early Warning System (Cek Lubang Terdekat dari GPS)
### ==========================================================================
# @name getNearbyPothole
GET {{baseUrl}}/pothole-clusters/nearby?lat=-6.208800&lon=106.845600&radius=50
Accept: application/json

### ==========================================================================
### STEP 6: Ambil Detail Pothole Cluster Berdasarkan UUID
### Ganti :clusterId dengan ID dari response Step 4 / Step 5
### ==========================================================================
@clusterId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

# @name getClusterDetail
GET {{baseUrl}}/pothole-clusters/{{clusterId}}
Accept: application/json

### ==========================================================================
### STEP 7: Update Status Perbaikan oleh Admin/PU
### ==========================================================================
# @name updateClusterStatus
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/pothole-clusters/{{clusterId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "verified",
  "severity": "high"
}
